<template>
  <Teleport to="body">
    <dialog ref="dialog" class="view-dialog public-views-info-dialog" :class="{'is-museum':museum,'is-centred':centred,'is-dark':dark,'is-closing':closing}" :style="viewportStyle" aria-labelledby="public-views-info-title" aria-describedby="public-views-info-copy" @cancel.prevent="leave('close')" @keydown.stop>
      <header class="view-dialog-head">
        <h2 id="public-views-info-title"><GalleryMark v-if="museum && !note"/>{{ note ? 'A note from Henry' : museum ? 'The View Gallery' : 'About Views' }}</h2>
        <button ref="close" type="button" class="view-dialog-close" aria-label="Close dialog" @click="leave('close')">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 5 10 10M15 5 5 15" /></svg>
        </button>
      </header>
      <ViewAboutContent v-if="note" id="public-views-info-copy" @project="leave('close')"/>
      <div v-else-if="museum" id="public-views-info-copy" class="public-views-info-copy gallery-introduction">
        <p>The View Gallery turns questions about Henry&rsquo;s life and work into exhibitions. AI connects his writing, projects and photographs into a reading, called a <AiViewTerm />. Each one becomes a series of rooms you can explore.</p>
        <p>Choose an exhibition in Browse, then go to the Entrance. Create begins with your own question, and Archive lets you explore the original material. You can switch any exhibition to its article presentation.</p>
      </div>
      <div v-else id="public-views-info-copy" class="public-views-info-copy">
        <p>Each <AiViewTerm /> begins with a visitor&rsquo;s question or perspective. AI brings together Henry&rsquo;s work, ideas and experiences, then composes a narrative around the connections it finds.</p>
        <p>The Gallery gives that reading a physical form. Its rooms place the narrative beside the original sources that support it. The same <AiViewTerm /> is also available as an article.</p>
        <p>The collection gathers <AiViewTerm plural /> that visitors have chosen to make public. Visitors can follow their questions through the Gallery and leave a note after the exhibition.</p>
      </div>
      <p v-if="!note" class="gallery-activity-note">Henry keeps private visit records to improve the site, including approximate country, device, clicks and time spent. <button type="button" @click="toggleActivity">{{analyticsOn ? 'Turn off visit recording' : 'Turn on visit recording'}}</button></p>
      <GalleryProjectLink v-if="museum && !note" class="public-views-project-link" @project="leave('close')"/>
      <MuseumFloorPlan v-if="museum && !note" :area="area" :dark="dark" @navigate="leave('navigate',$event)"/>
      <button v-if="museum && !note && tourAvailable" class="public-views-tour" type="button" @click="leave('tour')"><span>Take the Gallery tour</span><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="8"/><path d="m8 6.5 5 3.5-5 3.5Z"/></svg></button>
      <p v-if="!note && !museum" class="public-views-info-removal">To remove a <AiViewTerm /> you&rsquo;ve shared, <a href="mailto:whenry6688@gmail.com?subject=Public%20View%20removal">email Henry</a> with its link.</p>
